Package: getodds
Type: Package
Title: Bounded Reads from the GetOdds Sports Data Gateway
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("GetOdds", "Team", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "support@getoddsapi.com")
Description: Reads four scoped player-threshold samples and stored DraftKings sportsbook
    resources with explicit limits, response validation and sanitized errors.
    Does not automatically retry requests or retrieve additional pages.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: curl, jsonlite
URL: https://getoddsapi.com, https://github.com/getoddsapi/getodds-r
BugReports: https://github.com/getoddsapi/getodds-r/issues
